    "content" : "where Ck,m ∈ CN×N refers to the spatial correlation matrix of the Rayleigh-distributed non-line-of-sight (NLoS) components. The corresponding large-scale fading coefficient (LSF), which includes path loss, is tr(Ck,m)/N."
